00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.100
Who knows?

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.520
Then...

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:44.270
All girls.

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:47.350
They all seriously say the love me. It's a pain.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.100
Admiration, maybe?

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.810
Like with Takarazuka?

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:51.730
Yeah.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:54.600
But you don't like that, right, Momo?

00:12:57.150 --> 00:12:59.730
God sure is cruel.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:04.440
Outside food and drink are prohibited.

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:08.310
More importantly, buy your Eggs and leave.

00:13:08.310 --> 00:13:10.560
Come on, let us play one game.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:14.190
This is basically a kind of group therapy.

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:17.600
Yeah, to let us feel that we're not alone.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:21.020
We might kill ourselves without it.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.650
Just one game.

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.060
Yes!

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:31.730
I couldn't even reach the pins before.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:33.270
I'm getting buff.

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.190
Thank God for Eggs.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:38.480
Your turn, Momoe.

00:13:38.480 --> 00:13:39.480
Okay.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:41.940
Whoa.

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:43.810
It's like a date photo.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:47.020
All my photos with girls come out like that.

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.020
I'll save it.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:47.980
See?

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.940
Wow, you're right.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.810
Oh, this picture's cute.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:56.690
Haruka took this one for me.

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.310
Haruka was willing to see me as a girl.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.400
Your friend who killed herself?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.850
Yeah.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:08.230
But she suddenly took
her clothes off in the infirmary.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:11.190
She put the moves on you? Whoa.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:14.850
I got scared and ended up pushing her away.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:16.310
I get that.

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:19.770
You don't expect it to come
from a girl who's your friend.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:23.940
I got chills! I was shaking!

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.230
What should I have done?

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.560
Well, let's drop the gloomy talk.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.020
There are lots of other games.
Let's play our hearts out.

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.810
Yeah, let's!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:41.190
What do you mean?

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.900
You promised you'd only play one game.

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:45.190
Come on!

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.560
Buy Eggs.

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:47.690
This place is--

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.730
Ura-Acca!

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.560
Where's the harm?

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:58.770
Play well, fight well.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.440
What's that, Ai?

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:15.690
You don't completely hate being popular,
do you? Even with girls?

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:19.940
Well, I guess I care about the girls
who follow me on Insta and things.

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.270
You're half-hearted.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:26.230
Sometimes you end up enjoying something
even though you didn't mean to.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.060
Really?

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:27.980
I did it!

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:30.270
Damn it!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.100
Maybe so.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.190
I couldn't beat you even once.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.020
Games like that are kind of my thing.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.100
That was a first.

00:15:36.020 --> 00:15:37.980
A gamer? You secretly a nerd?

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:37.980
Same for me.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.150
That's normal, isn't it?

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:41.560
You're totally a nerd.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.560
You're totally a nerd.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:45.060
Now, buy your Eggs, go home, and go to sleep.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.400
What? I don't wanna leave.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:52.350
I'm having the time of my life.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:55.850
Yeah, I haven't had this much fun in ages.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.100
Good grief. It's your fault for spoiling them.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:03.730
I'm not spoiling them; soldiers need their rest.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.600
Oh, yeah; Neiru, can I have your contact info?

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.350
Yes. Tell me yours, too.

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.770
Too much rest will make them
slack off like you do.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.770
Oh, sure. Here's mine.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.600
You're so uptight.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.060
How about we just stop buying Eggs?

00:16:12.060 --> 00:16:12.980
Huh?

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:17.020
Now I think about it,
Chiemi went and died on her own.

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:20.520
It might be true that I was the reason,

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.770
but dying isn't playing fair.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.350
Do I have to feel so responsible?

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:26.190
Seriously?

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.480
It's true, isn't it?

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.730
I knew it. What Ai saw was just an act.

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:31.940
No!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:36.100
I'm a woman, so I get swept away
by my emotions in the moment.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.480
Hey, Rika...

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:39.150
What about you, Momoe?

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.350
Huh?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.770
Are you responsible?

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:46.150
Of course you feel guilty. So do I.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:52.270
But should we really feel so responsible
that we'd risk our own lives?

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.560
Well...

00:16:55.560 --> 00:16:56.980
Rika...

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.730
...stop it already.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:02.560
Especially you, Ai.

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:05.440
She died without even talking to you.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.270
That's not your fault.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:10.810
So, why do you have to go fight?

00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:16.600
Because I want to know
the truth about why Koito died.

00:17:16.600 --> 00:17:19.730
That curiosity could get you killed!

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:22.900
My parents are one thing,
but you've got a great mom.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.900
You want to make her sad?!

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:32.270
You don't even know if Koito <i>wants</i>
to come back to life in the first place!

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:33.690
That's not...

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:38.650
What, did Koito's statue
tell you she wants to come back?

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.060
Why would you say that?!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:40.980
Rika, stop it.

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:42.900
Someone has to be the bad guy!

00:17:42.900 --> 00:17:45.270
If you want friends, you've got 'em!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:49.560
Sorry, but I'm going.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.150
I don't want to go, but I have to.

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:53.690
What for?!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:57.810
For someone selfish enough to...
kill themselves...?

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.600
Rika, Neiru's trying to save her sister.

00:18:00.600 --> 00:18:02.310
Wrong.

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:05.020
Wrong about what?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.980
My sister stabbed me.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.520
Huh?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.400
Then, she ran away and jumped off a bridge.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.150
That's...

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.560
That's what they told me
when I woke up in the ICU.

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:19.520
Then you've got even less of a reason.

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:22.690
The scar aches and keeps me awake.

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:27.100
But the pain has faded
since I started going there.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:34.190
When I try to forget her,
my scar aches, like a curse.

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:38.480
That's why I go.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:41.810
No other reason.

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.560
It's for me.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.730
You don't have to go if you don't want to.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:55.900
Guilt and curiosity fade.
Sooner or later, you'll forget 'em.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:58.900
It's fine. You don't have to go.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.690
Good, right?

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:02.560
I mean,

00:19:02.560 --> 00:19:05.230
that's just adolescence.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:17.060
Mirror, mirror on the wall,
who's the fairest of them all?

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:12.020
Beauty is a momentary season of metamorphosis.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.690
Dying is the same.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:17.060
Killing your own beautiful body
is another metamorphosis.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:21.310
Getting old and ugly or trying
to resist aging are both comedy.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.310
There must be a real one.

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.600
Just comedy!

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.440
Who is it?

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:27.400
Who?

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.190
Who?

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.980
I'm going to blow your mind.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:55.900
How did you...?

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.150
I didn't.

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:59.350
You just got on my nerves.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:01.480
You actually regret it, right?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:05.900
After all, no one will
call you pretty ever again.

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.980
"Why don't I die," huh?

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:21.850
You tempted me to die, didn't you?

00:20:58.850 --> 00:20:59.940
Well done.

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.150
Teenage rebellion.

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:05.440
They'll want to go if we say not to.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:09.770
They know that doing that
will build up their own identities.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:16.400
Ai, lend me money.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:17.170
I'm out.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.690
You're kidding.

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:02.020
Next time

00:22:58.310 --> 00:22:59.850
To be continued.
